## 7. Multi-Agent Integration Guide

- **Antigravity (Google / Gemini):** Reads `AGENTS.md` and discovers all skills in `.agents/skills/*/SKILL.md`.
- **Claude Code (Anthropic):** Reads `CLAUDE.md` (which imports `@AGENTS.md`), loads `.claude-plugin/plugin.json`, executes slash commands, and enforces safety hooks.
- **Cursor / Windsurf:** Loads `.cursorrules` or `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` generated from this devkit.
- **Synchronization:** Run `./bin/agent-kit sync` anytime new skills, rules, or aliases are modified.
